sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Foydalanuvchi
    participant B as Brauzer
    participant URL as URL Router<br/>(urls.py)
    participant V as View<br/>(views.py)
    participant M as Model<br/>(models.py)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant T as Template<br/>(*.html)

    U->>B: /en/analytics/ ni ochadi
    B->>URL: HTTP GET /en/analytics/
    URL->>URL: i18n_patterns matching<br/>active_lang = 'en'
    URL->>V: analytics_overview(request)
    V->>M: Post.objects.filter(account__user=u)
    M->>DB: SELECT * FROM social_post WHERE ...
    DB-->>M: rowlar
    M-->>V: QuerySet
    V->>V: aggregate, format ctx
    V->>T: render('analytics.html', ctx)
    T->>T: {% trans %} → en strings<br/>{% for %} loops
    T-->>V: rendered HTML
    V-->>URL: HttpResponse(200)
    URL-->>B: HTML + Content-Type
    B-->>U: KPI cards, chartlar
